# Stray npm lockfile: backend/ is .NET and has no package.json. An empty
# lockfile lands here whenever someone runs npm in the wrong directory.
# Deliberately NOT a bare `package-lock.json` — frontend/package-lock.json is
# tracked and must stay that way.
/backend/package-lock.json
